  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TRDP fas 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRDP phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet &#xe4;r en andra fas av ett landbygdsutvecklingprojekt i Topola, Serbien, Topola Rural Development Programme (TRDP). TRDP syftar till utveckling inom tre omr&#xe5;den; Community (st&#xf6;d till NGOs och mikrokrediter i byar), Municipal (kommundministration) samt Business (st&#xf6;d till SMEs och jordbruksseltorn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme is a second phase of the Topola Rural Development Programme (TRDP). It aims at developing Topola municipality i three different facilities; Municipal, Business and Community.TRDP include support to reform of the municipal administration, SME-development, agriculture associations, NGOs and microcredits in the rural villages.</narrative>
  </description>
